OL,3,GNEWSAThief breaks into cafe in
OL,4,Acathedral grounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief broke into a cafe in the
OL,7,Fgrounds of a cathedral and took money
OL,8,Fand alcohol.
OL,10,FStaff arrived at Cath, an independently
OL,11,Frun cafe inside Becket's ChapeI in the
OL,12,Fgrounds of Peterborough Cathedral, on
OL,13,FThursday morning to find the damage.
OL,15,FCo-owner Sam Smith told the BBC that
OL,16,FCCTV showed a masked man smashing the
OL,17,Fwindow with a rock and wandering around
OL,18,Fthe cafe on Wednesday night.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
